{"v":4,"catch":"成為“抵抗軍”，打敗“鎮壓軍”！ ！","desc":"《NEBULASRAY》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment）於1994年推出的射擊遊戲。\n成為抵抗軍的一員，擊敗發動政變的聯合軍組織的鎮壓軍。\n獲勝的關鍵是獲取沿途出現的物品並增強你的船隻。\t\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-05-15","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1f5e8ae7fa6764ac9bfb542d110fe577416746070b4f63dea37aeef98123e412.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e5515b70bbe74e3fed21d1551bd65f15190f01d593fc8b9001e0d77da9c69c58.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5e0408e6644871c85c3e254e5d4ee8adb61c615c68f8fdce9263b497d11d9ba6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5fe06f469a6b2f439bc90dce392004e86b10c2b126e714217d4f94668bdc141b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4c2377784a6ba27d4e10f28c262b6c4aa1a3ca35e516a29aea447036165dc46f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/732dc26835111ea0039e157552d9c250b673efd1f4b1ba2a8f0680e98ec3fc2a.jpg"],"titleId":"0100f2a022b3c000","dlc":[]}